............... 20 \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "}, {"page": 5, "text": " \n \n5 \n \n1. Contact \n1.1. Contact organization General Authority for Statistics \n1.2. Contact organization unit  Environment, Agriculture and Energy Statistics \nDepartment \n1.3. Contact person function Director of Environment, Agriculture and Energy Statistics \nDepartment \n1.4. Contact mail address \nP.O. Box: 3735 \nRiyadh, 11481 \nKingdom of Saudi Arabia \n1.5. Contact email address info@stats.gov.sa \n1.6. Contact phone number 199009 \n \n2. Methodology and Quality Update \n2.1. Methodology and Quality last update 30/12/2024 \n3. Statistical Presentation \n3.1. Data description   \nThe water accounts present data on the environmental and economic aspects of water in \nSaudi Arabia.  \nWater Accounts is a statistical product whose data is collected  mainly through administrative \nrecords data on the main characteristics as follows: \n\u2022 Water supply by water source (physical and monetary) \n\u2022 Water use by industrial activity and households (physical and monetary) "}]}
